* g1_top_interconnect_rc: distributed RC of the top-level routing of g1_chip_top (r4), element lines for the
* body of the deck-local g1_chip_top (run_top_cdl.py --interconnect extracted-rc; pin renames in the map JSON).
* R: KLayout RNetExtractor (square counting, kpex ihp-sg13g2 sheet/via tables) on the fill-free top-interconnect view,
* Kron-reduced onto the pin nodes of each network fragment (exact at DC).
* C: kpex 0.3.12 2.5D CC on the same view. Extracted, not measured. Inputs (sha256): rnet 301534952b2a0685, csv d8cc7ac616bcf039.
* 334 resistors, 4759 capacitors; 14 network components tied to their net node (see map JSON).
